  "definition": "Fraudulent Activities",
  "effectiveDate": "2013-08-15",
  "historyNote": "#6337, eff 9-25-96 (from Saf-C 203.14); ss by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13",
